Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:06.25,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}想見妳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.25,0:01:09.26,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}きみに会いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.25,0:01:09.26,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}好想見妳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.01,0:01:12.55,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}会いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.01,0:01:12.55,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}想見妳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:16.06,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}きみに会いたい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:16.06,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}好想見妳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:21.69,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}たとえば　きみと僕を二つ足してさ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:21.69,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}如果有一種魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.69,0:01:25.77,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}はんぶんこにちぎる魔法があれば
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.69,0:01:25.77,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}可以將妳我相融再一分為二
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.77,0:01:28.90,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}サヨナラのない永遠になれるのかな
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.77,0:01:28.90,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}是否就可以不再道別互為永遠了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:31.91,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみがいないのなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:31.91,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日妳將不在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.91,0:01:34.95,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}僕は後悔するのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.91,0:01:34.95,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}我定會追悔莫及
